# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Asthana et al. (2025), MNRAS 542, 2968 (arXiv:2409.15453), Fig. 3 panel B (blue): volume-averaged <x_HI>_v at the snapshots (broken axis: log below 0.1).
#   "QSO-only" run: no stellar sources; AGN in 10% of the haloes (>= 1e9 Msun/h; 10 Myr lifetime, f_esc = 1,
